{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 41,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 259.093,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.393,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my son,",
      "verse": "41:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 1.573,
      "end": 6.728,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have somewhat to say concerning the restoration of which has been spoken;",
      "verse": "41:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 6.908,
      "end": 9.973,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, some have wrested the scriptures,",
      "verse": "41:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.153,
      "end": 13.311,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have gone far astray because of this thing.",
      "verse": "41:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 13.491,
      "end": 17.717,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I perceive that thy mind has been worried also concerning this thing.",
      "verse": "41:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 17.897,
      "end": 20.405,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I will explain it unto thee.",
      "verse": "41:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 21.085,
      "end": 22.664,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I say unto thee, my son,",
      "verse": "41:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 22.844,
      "end": 27.024,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the plan of restoration is requisite with the justice of God;",
      "verse": "41:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 27.204,
      "end": 32.591,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it is requisite that all things should be restored to their proper order.",
      "verse": "41:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 32.771,
      "end": 37.694,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, it is requisite and just, according to the power and resurrection of Christ,",
      "verse": "41:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 37.874,
      "end": 40.939,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the soul of man should be restored to its body,",
      "verse": "41:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 41.119,
      "end": 44.556,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that every part of the body should be restored to itself.",
      "verse": "41:2",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 45.236,
      "end": 47.883,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it is requisite with the justice of God",
      "verse": "41:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 48.063,
      "end": 51.128,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that men should be judged according to their works;",
      "verse": "41:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 51.308,
      "end": 54.002,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if their works were good in this life,",
      "verse": "41:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 54.182,
      "end": 56.365,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the desires of their hearts were good,",
      "verse": "41:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 56.545,
      "end": 61.561,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they should also, at the last day, be restored unto that which is good.",
      "verse": "41:3",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 62.241,
      "end": 64.424,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And if their works are evil",
      "verse": "41:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 64.604,
      "end": 67.112,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they shall be restored unto them for evil.",
      "verse": "41:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 67.292,
      "end": 71.054,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, all things shall be restored to their proper order,",
      "verse": "41:4",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 71.234,
      "end": 73.463,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "every thing to its natural frame\u2014",
      "verse": "41:4",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 73.643,
      "end": 77.915,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "mortality raised to immortality, corruption to incorruption\u2014",
      "verse": "41:4",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 78.095,
      "end": 81.671,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "raised to endless happiness to inherit the kingdom of God,",
      "verse": "41:4",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 81.851,
      "end": 85.334,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or to endless misery to inherit the kingdom of the devil,",
      "verse": "41:4",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 85.514,
      "end": 88.254,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the one on one hand, the other on the other\u2014",
      "verse": "41:4",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 88.934,
      "end": 92.835,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The one raised to happiness according to his desires of happiness,",
      "verse": "41:5",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 93.015,
      "end": 95.894,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or good according to his desires of good;",
      "verse": "41:5",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 96.074,
      "end": 99.557,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the other to evil according to his desires of evil;",
      "verse": "41:5",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 99.737,
      "end": 103.034,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for as he has desired to do evil all the day long",
      "verse": "41:5",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 103.214,
      "end": 107.579,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so shall he have his reward of evil when the night cometh.",
      "verse": "41:5",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 108.259,
      "end": 110.117,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And so it is on the other hand.",
      "verse": "41:6",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 110.297,
      "end": 112.712,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "If he hath repented of his sins,",
      "verse": "41:6",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 112.892,
      "end": 116.282,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and desired righteousness until the end of his days,",
      "verse": "41:6",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 116.462,
      "end": 119.573,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so he shall be rewarded unto righteousness.",
      "verse": "41:6",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 120.253,
      "end": 122.761,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "These are they that are redeemed of the Lord;",
      "verse": "41:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 122.941,
      "end": 125.681,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, these are they that are taken out,",
      "verse": "41:7",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 125.861,
      "end": 129.483,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that are delivered from that endless night of darkness;",
      "verse": "41:7",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 129.663,
      "end": 131.335,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus they stand or fall;",
      "verse": "41:7",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 131.515,
      "end": 133.976,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, they are their own judges,",
      "verse": "41:7",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 134.156,
      "end": 136.385,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whether to do good or do evil.",
      "verse": "41:7",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 137.065,
      "end": 139.805,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now, the decrees of God are unalterable;",
      "verse": "41:8",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 139.985,
      "end": 142.4,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, the way is prepared",
      "verse": "41:8",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 142.58,
      "end": 145.691,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that whosoever will may walk therein and be saved.",
      "verse": "41:8",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 146.371,
      "end": 147.904,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, my son,",
      "verse": "41:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 148.084,
      "end": 152.682,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "do not risk one more offense against your God upon those points of doctrine,",
      "verse": "41:9",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 152.862,
      "end": 156.02,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which ye have hitherto risked to commit sin.",
      "verse": "41:9",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 156.7,
      "end": 163.991,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Do not suppose, because it has been spoken concerning restoration, that ye shall be restored from sin to happiness.",
      "verse": "41:10",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 164.171,
      "end": 165.843,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I say unto you,",
      "verse": "41:10",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 166.023,
      "end": 168.206,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wickedness never was happiness.",
      "verse": "41:10",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 168.886,
      "end": 170.279,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my son,",
      "verse": "41:11",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 170.459,
      "end": 180.026,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "all men that are in a state of nature, or I would say, in a carnal state, are in the gall of bitterness and in the bonds of iniquity;",
      "verse": "41:11",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 180.206,
      "end": 182.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they are without God in the world,",
      "verse": "41:11",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 182.476,
      "end": 185.402,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they have gone contrary to the nature of God;",
      "verse": "41:11",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 185.582,
      "end": 190.598,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, they are in a state contrary to the nature of happiness.",
      "verse": "41:11",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 191.278,
      "end": 195.04,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, is the meaning of the word restoration",
      "verse": "41:12",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 195.22,
      "end": 197.867,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to take a thing of a natural state",
      "verse": "41:12",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 198.547,
      "end": 200.776,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O, my son, this is not the case;",
      "verse": "41:13",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 200.956,
      "end": 206.018,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but the meaning of the word restoration is to bring back again evil for evil,",
      "verse": "41:13",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 206.198,
      "end": 211.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or carnal for carnal, or devilish for devilish\u2014 good for that which is good;",
      "verse": "41:13",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 211.719,
      "end": 213.995,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "righteous for that which is righteous;",
      "verse": "41:13",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 214.175,
      "end": 216.079,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "just for that which is just;",
      "verse": "41:13",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 216.259,
      "end": 218.813,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "merciful for that which is merciful.",
      "verse": "41:13",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 219.493,
      "end": 220.933,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, my son,",
      "verse": "41:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 221.113,
      "end": 224.039,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "see that you are merciful unto your brethren;",
      "verse": "41:14",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 224.219,
      "end": 226.959,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "deal justly, judge righteously,",
      "verse": "41:14",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 227.139,
      "end": 229.043,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and do good continually;",
      "verse": "41:14",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 229.223,
      "end": 232.845,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if ye do all these things then shall ye receive your reward;",
      "verse": "41:14",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 233.025,
      "end": 236.044,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, ye shall have mercy restored unto you again;",
      "verse": "41:14",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 236.224,
      "end": 239.289,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall have justice restored unto you again;",
      "verse": "41:14",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 239.469,
      "end": 243.184,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall have a righteous judgment restored unto you again;",
      "verse": "41:14",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 243.364,
      "end": 245.965,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye shall have good rewarded unto you again.",
      "verse": "41:14",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 246.645,
      "end": 251.846,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For that which ye do send out shall return unto you again, and be restored;",
      "verse": "41:15",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 252.026,
      "end": 256.113,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, the word restoration more fully condemneth the sinner,",
      "verse": "41:15",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 256.293,
      "end": 258.429,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and justifieth him not at all.",
      "verse": "41:15",
      "lineIndex": 75
    }
  ]
}